            <ArticleTitle>Use of a biological extracellular matrix wound therapy to heal complex, chronic wounds.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>70-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This small case series involved four patients with vascular impairment and multiple comorbidities whose wounds had not responded to standard treatment. Use of this novel therapy help initiate wound healing and improve quality of life.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
